/T (Presented as a solution for fighting terrorism and organized crime, Pegasus has been revealed by several civil society organizations and investigative journalists to be used against political opponents, human rights activists, journalists, executives, and officials within and beyond the borders of the client State. The echo given to these disclosures was largely influenced by the number and standing of identified victims. )
