/T (Such definition aligns better with cyberspace parameters since the concept of territorial integrity infringement can be broadly interpreted. However, defining a "concerted act of violence" in the context of ICT use raises significant socio-technical challenges. In particular, unpacking intents and the organizational degree of a virtually constituted group adds a layer of complexity to the already intricate attribution issue. )
