/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (While this definition captures activities akin to those of notable entities such as NSO, it faces two important challenges. Firstly, its breadth may encompass a wide array of activities, potentially diluting its specificity. By focusing on "business entities," it also risks excluding various non-corporate actors, including underground entities, groups, or individuals operating beyond the purview of traditional market structures.)
/E (While this definition captures activities akin to those of notable entities such as NSO, it faces two important challenges. Firstly, its breadth may encompass a wide array of activities, potentially diluting its specificity. By focusing on "business entities," it also risks excluding various non-corporate actors, including underground entities, groups, or individuals operating beyond the purview of traditional market structures.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
